      <guid>http://localhost:1313/tools/pump-sizing/guided-wizard/</guid>
      <description>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&#34;en&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta charset=&#34;UTF-8&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta name=&#34;viewport&#34; content=&#34;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;title&gt;PKYDrip Pump Sizing Guided Wizard&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta name=&#34;description&#34; content=&#34;A guided wizard to help growers and contractors choose the right pump sizing and irrigation control direction.&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;    body {&#xA;      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;      background: #f7f9fb;&#xA;      color: #222;&#xA;      margin: 0;&#xA;      padding: 0;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .wrap {&#xA;      max-width: 820px;&#xA;      margin: 0 auto;&#xA;      padding: 36px 20px 60px;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .hero,&#xA;    .card {&#xA;      background: #ffffff;&#xA;      border: 1px solid #e6edf3;&#xA;      border-radius: 16px;&#xA;      padding: 24px;&#xA;      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);&#xA;      margin-bottom: 20px;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    h1, h2, h3 {&#xA;      margin-top: 0;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .hero p {&#xA;      color: #555;&#xA;      line-height: 1.7;&#xA;      margin-bottom: 0;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .step {&#xA;      display: none;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .step.active {&#xA;      display: block;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .step-label {&#xA;      display: inline-block;&#xA;      font-size: 13px;&#xA;      font-weight: 700;&#xA;      color: #1f7a4d;&#xA;      background: #eef7f1;&#xA;      border-radius: 999px;&#xA;      padding: 6px 10px;&#xA;      margin-bottom: 12px;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .step-title {&#xA;      font-size: 22px;&#xA;      font-weight: 700;&#xA;      margin-bottom: 8px;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .hint {&#xA;      color: #666;&#xA;      font-size: 14px;&#xA;      margin-bottom: 14px;&#xA;      line-height: 1.6;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    select {&#xA;      width: 100%;&#xA;      padding: 13px 14px;&#xA;      border: 1px solid #d7e2ea;&#xA;      border-radius: 10px;&#xA;      font-size: 15px;&#xA;      margin-top: 8px;&#xA;      background: #fff;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .actions {&#xA;      display: flex;&#xA;      gap: 12px;&#xA;      flex-wrap: wrap;&#xA;      margin-top: 18px;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    button,&#xA;    .btn-link {&#xA;      display: inline-block;&#xA;      border: none;&#xA;      border-radius: 10px;&#xA;      padding: 12px 18px;&#xA;      font-weight: 700;&#xA;      text-decoration: none;&#xA;      cursor: pointer;&#xA;      font-size: 15px;&#xA;      transition: 0.2s ease;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    button {&#xA;      background: #1f7a4d;&#xA;      color: #fff;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    button:hover {&#xA;      background: #18633e;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .btn-link {&#xA;      background: #fff;&#xA;      color: #1f7a4d;&#xA;      border: 1px solid #cfe3d8;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .btn-link:hover {&#xA;      background: #f5fbf7;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .result {&#xA;      display: none;&#xA;      margin-top: 22px;&#xA;      padding: 20px;&#xA;      border-radius: 14px;&#xA;      background: #f3f8f5;&#xA;      border: 1px solid #d8efe1;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .summary {&#xA;      color: #444;&#xA;      line-height: 1.8;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .recommendation-box {&#xA;      background: #fff;&#xA;      border: 1px solid #d8efe1;&#xA;      border-radius: 12px;&#xA;      padding: 16px;&#xA;      margin: 16px 0;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .recommendation-box p {&#xA;      margin: 0 0 8px 0;&#xA;      line-height: 1.7;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .recommendation-box p:last-child {&#xA;      margin-bottom: 0;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .small-note {&#xA;      color: #666;&#xA;      font-size: 13px;&#xA;      margin-top: 14px;&#xA;      line-height: 1.6;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .progress {&#xA;      display: flex;&#xA;      gap: 8px;&#xA;      margin: 0 0 20px 0;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .progress span {&#xA;      flex: 1;&#xA;      height: 8px;&#xA;      border-radius: 999px;&#xA;      background: #dfe8ee;&#xA;    }&#xA;&#xA;    .progress span.active {&#xA;      background: #1f7a4d;&#xA;    }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;wrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;hero&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h1&gt;Pump Sizing Guided Wizard&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;      &lt;p&gt;&#xA;        This guided tool helps growers, contractors, and project owners choose the most suitable next step&#xA;        for an irrigation project. If you are not yet sure whether you should use the calculator,&#xA;        submit a request form, or discuss the project directly with PKYDrip, start here.&#xA;      &lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/tools/pump-sizing/pump-sizing-calculator-v2/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/tools/pump-sizing/pump-sizing-calculator-v2/</guid>
      <description>&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&#34;en&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta charset=&#34;utf-8&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta name=&#34;viewport&#34; content=&#34;width=device-width,initial-scale=1&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;title&gt;PKYDrip – Pump Sizing Wizard (Simple / Engineer Mode)&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;    :root { --bg:#0b1220; --card:#111a2e; --text:#e8eefc; --muted:#a9b7d6; --line:#24324f; --accent:#4cc3ff; }&#xA;    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#070c16,#0b1220);color:var(--text);}&#xA;    .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px;}&#xA;    h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 8px;}&#xA;    p{margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}&#xA;    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px}&#xA;    .card{background:rgba(17,26,46,.92);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px}&#xA;    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}&#xA;    label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 6px}&#xA;    input,select{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0b1326;color:var(--text);outline:none}&#xA;    input:focus,select:focus{border-color:rgba(76,195,255,.7);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(76,195,255,.15)}&#xA;    .btns{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}&#xA;    button{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0b1326;color:var(--text);cursor:pointer}&#xA;    button.primary{border-color:rgba(76,195,255,.7);background:rgba(76,195,255,.12)}&#xA;    .kpi{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:10px}&#xA;    .k{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;background:rgba(11,19,38,.6)}&#xA;    .k .t{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}&#xA;    .k .v{font-size:18px;margin-top:6px}&#xA;    .mono{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,monospace}&#xA;    .hr{height:1px;background:var(--line);margin:12px 0}&#xA;    .note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}&#xA;    .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);margin-right:6px}&#xA;    .warn{color:#ffd27a}&#xA;    .ok{color:#8bffb0}&#xA;    .small{font-size:12px}&#xA;    .hide{display:none !important;}&#xA;    .modebar{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}&#xA;    .modebtn{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0b1326;color:var(--text)}&#xA;    .modebtn.active{border-color:rgba(76,195,255,.8);background:rgba(76,195,255,.12)}&#xA;    .pill{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(11,19,38,.45)}&#xA;    .miniBtns{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}&#xA;    .miniBtns button{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px}&#xA;    a.cta{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;margin-top:10px}&#xA;    a.ctaBlue{background:#4cc3ff;color:#000}&#xA;    a.ctaGreen{background:#25D366;color:#000}&#xA;    @media (max-width: 920px){ .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;wrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;PKYDrip – Pump Sizing Wizard&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;&#xA;    Estimate &lt;b&gt;required pump flow&lt;/b&gt;, the impact of &lt;b&gt;rotation zoning&lt;/b&gt;, and solar-friendly design.&#xA;  &lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/tools/pump-sizing/pump-sizing-request-form/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/tools/pump-sizing/pump-sizing-request-form/</guid>
      <description>&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&#34;en&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta charset=&#34;utf-8&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta name=&#34;viewport&#34; content=&#34;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;title&gt;Pump Sizing Request Form | PKYDrip Tools&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta name=&#34;description&#34; content=&#34;Submit pump sizing info for irrigation projects. We will recommend pump size and automation package based on head, flow, irrigation type, and zones.&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;    :root{&#xA;      --border:#e5e7eb; --text:#111827; --muted:#6b7280;&#xA;      --bg:#ffffff; --bg2:#f9fafb;&#xA;      --btn:#16a34a; --btn2:#0f172a; --btnText:#ffffff;&#xA;      --input:#d1d5db;&#xA;    }&#xA;    body{font-family: system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial; color:var(--text); background:var(--bg2); margin:0; padding:24px;}&#xA;    .wrap{max-width:920px; margin:0 auto;}&#xA;    .card{background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:14px; padding:18px;}&#xA;    h1{font-size:22px; margin:0 0 8px;}&#xA;    p{margin:0 0 14px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--muted);}&#xA;    fieldset{border:0; padding:0; margin:0 0 14px;}&#xA;    legend{font-weight:700; margin:8px 0;}&#xA;    label{display:block; margin:10px 0 6px; font-weight:600;}&#xA;    input, select, textarea{&#xA;      width:100%; padding:10px; border:1px solid var(--input); border-radius:10px; background:#fff;&#xA;      font-size:14px; box-sizing:border-box;&#xA;    }&#xA;    .row{display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;}&#xA;    .row &gt; *{flex:1; min-width:180px;}&#xA;    .hint{margin-top:6px; color:var(--muted); font-size:13px;}&#xA;    .actions{display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; margin-top:10px;}&#xA;    .btn{&#xA;      display:inline-block; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:12px; text-decoration:none; border:0;&#xA;      cursor:pointer; font-weight:700;&#xA;    }&#xA;    .btn-primary{background:var(--btn); color:var(--btnText);}&#xA;    .btn-dark{background:var(--btn2); color:var(--btnText);}&#xA;    .note{font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.5;}&#xA;    .topbar{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-bottom:12px;}&#xA;    .tag{font-size:12px; padding:6px 10px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:999px; color:var(--muted); background:#fff;}&#xA;    hr{border:0; border-top:1px solid var(--border); margin:16px 0;}&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;wrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;topbar&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;tag&#34;&gt;PKYDrip Tools • Pump Sizing&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-dark&#34; href=&#34;https://wa.me/8613803373007?text=Hi%20PKYDrip%2C%20I%20need%20help%20with%20pump%20sizing.%20Source%3A%20tools%2Fpump-sizing-request-form&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        WhatsApp Quick Chat&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;card&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h1&gt;Pump Sizing Request Form&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;      &lt;p&gt;&#xA;        Fill this form to help us recommend the correct pump size and automation package.&#xA;        Key factors: &lt;b&gt;head (elevation)&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;irrigation type&lt;/b&gt;, and &lt;b&gt;zones running at the same time&lt;/b&gt;.&#xA;      &lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/tools/pump-sizing/sprinkler-gun-pump-sizing-chart/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/tools/pump-sizing/sprinkler-gun-pump-sizing-chart/</guid>
      <description>&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&#34;en&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta charset=&#34;utf-8&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta name=&#34;viewport&#34; content=&#34;width=device-width,initial-scale=1&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;title&gt;Sprinkler Gun Pump Sizing Quick Chart | Flow vs Head vs HP&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta name=&#34;description&#34; content=&#34;Quick reference chart: sprinkler gun flow vs head vs recommended pump motor power (kW/HP). Single-gun estimates + real-world head loss notes. Ideal for fast budgeting and WhatsApp replies.&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;meta name=&#34;robots&#34; content=&#34;index,follow&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;    :root{&#xA;      --b:#e6e6e6; --t:#111827; --m:#6b7280; --bg:#ffffff; --bg2:#f9fafb;&#xA;      --green:#16a34a; --dark:#0f172a;&#xA;    }&#xA;    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--t);background:var(--bg2);}&#xA;    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 16px 40px;}&#xA;    .topbar{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px;}&#xA;    .tag{font-size:12px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#374151;}&#xA;    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--b);background:#fff;text-decoration:none;color:var(--t);font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}&#xA;    .btn:hover{background:#f3f4f6}&#xA;    .btn-green{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);color:#fff}&#xA;    .btn-green:hover{filter:brightness(0.95)}&#xA;    h1{font-size:22px;margin:10px 0 6px;}&#xA;    h2{font-size:16px;margin:14px 0 8px;}&#xA;    p{color:var(--m);line-height:1.55;margin:6px 0 12px;}&#xA;    .note{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;}&#xA;    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;}&#xA;    @media (min-width:960px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr}}&#xA;    table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;}&#xA;    thead th{background:#f3f4f6;text-align:left;font-weight:800;padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b);font-size:13px;}&#xA;    tbody td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b);font-size:13px;vertical-align:top;}&#xA;    tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0;}&#xA;    .kpi{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}&#xA;    .pill{border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#374151;background:#fff;}&#xA;    .small{font-size:12px;color:var(--m);}&#xA;    .muted{color:var(--m);}&#xA;    .strong{font-weight:800;color:#111827;}&#xA;    .warn{color:#8a2b2b;}&#xA;    .btnrow{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;}&#xA;    .footer{margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--m);}&#xA;    code{background:#f3f4f6;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:8px;}&#xA;    textarea{width:100%;min-height:120px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;}&#xA;    .hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--b);margin:14px 0;}&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;wrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;topbar&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;tag&#34;&gt;PKYDrip Tools • Pump Sizing • Sprinkler Gun Chart&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div style=&#34;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;btn&#34; href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/tools/&#34; title=&#34;Back to Tools&#34;&gt;← Tools&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;btn&#34; href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/tools/pump-sizing/pump-sizing-calculator-v2.html&#34; title=&#34;Pump sizing calculator&#34;&gt;Pump Sizing Calculator&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-green&#34; id=&#34;waTop&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;WhatsApp&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;h1&gt;Sprinkler Gun Pump Sizing Quick Chart&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&#xA;      Quick reference for &lt;span class=&#34;strong&#34;&gt;single sprinkler gun&lt;/span&gt; operation:&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;strong&#34;&gt;Flow (m³/h)&lt;/span&gt; × &lt;span class=&#34;strong&#34;&gt;Total Head (m)&lt;/span&gt; → recommended motor size.&#xA;      Use this for early budgeting and fast WhatsApp replies.&#xA;    &lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
